            "text": "[{\"ID\":19798,\"PartnerID\":2186,\"PartnerDescription\":null,\"ServiceTypeDescription\":\"Service Full\",\"AdditionalInformation\":\"<ul><li>Safety check</li><li>&nbsp;All bolts tightened &amp; checked including frame bolts behind guards</li><li>&nbsp;Check and adjust all brake related bolts</li><li>&nbsp;Brakes tested and adjusted/bleed</li><li>&nbsp;Check program settings on scooter</li><li>&nbsp;Check and adjust tyre inflation to recommended psi</li><li>&nbsp;Check and adjust suspension pivots</li><li>&nbsp;Check wheel alignment</li><li>&nbsp;Check and adjust headset. Tighten or loosen to torque spec</li><li>&nbsp;Check and adjust handlebars and fittings</li><li>&nbsp;Check, adjust and lubricate folding mechanism</li><li>&nbsp;Check light system</li></ul><p><br></p>\",\"AdditionalInformationApp\":null,\"IsFitting\":false,\"GroupName\":\"Services\",\"Hours\":1.0,\"Cost\":99.0,\"HasPartnerServiceType\":false,\"Show\":false,\"IsActive\":true,\"ServiceSKU\":\"\",\"TechnicianLinked\":false,\"LinkedTechnicians\":[],\"GroupOrder\":2,\"ServiceOrder\":1000,\"OverrideSKUPrice\":false,\"LinkedToThirdPartyName\":\"\",\"Radius\":0,\"DefaultChecklistItems\":[],\"skuLinked\":false},{\"ID\":19799,\"PartnerID\":2186,\"PartnerDescription\":null,\"ServiceTypeDescription\":\"Service  Plus\",\"AdditionalInformation\":\"<ul><li>Safety check</li><li>&nbsp;All bolts tightened &amp; checked including frame bolts behind guards</li><li>&nbsp;Check and adjust all brake related bolts</li><li>&nbsp;Brakes tested and adjusted/bleed</li><li>&nbsp;Check program settings on scooter</li><li>&nbsp;Check and adjust tyre inflation to recommended psi</li><li>&nbsp;Check and adjust suspension pivots</li><li>&nbsp;Check wheel alignment</li><li>&nbsp;Check and adjust headset. Tighten or loosen to torque spec</li><li>&nbsp;Check and adjust handlebars and fittings</li><li>&nbsp;Check, adjust and lubricate folding mechanism</li><li>&nbsp;Check light system</li><li>Minor electrical diag